		{"id":"b29eb2ef0e452cf8","type":"text","text":"评估：评估组 (Evaluation Group) 组件 (Component) Weight权重 满分要求 (Requirement to achieve full quality score)","x":763,"y":-125,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"85c2ac98194dff6e","type":"text","text":"评估组 (Evaluation Group) 组件 (Component) Weight权重 满分要求 (Requirement to achieve full quality score)","x":1402,"y":-122,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"3f23f9ce466d064a","type":"text","text":"1.a.是 Detail page (详情页)， Structured Attributes Quality(结构化属性质量)30% ,所有呈现在详情页“产品概述”和“深度信息”组件中的适用属性必须完整且正确。All applicable attributes displayed in detail page Product Overview and Depth Information widgets are complete and correct.","x":1920,"y":-508,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"6973b57534b23445","type":"text","text":"2.b.是 Detail page (详情页)， Title Quality (标题质量)25%,标题完整、正确，长度和大小写规范，关键词覆盖良好，无关键词堆砌及违规内容。Title is complete, correct, with correct length and casing, good coverage of keyword tagging, no keyword redundancy and restricted content.","x":1919,"y":-365,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"87a48d7c6b40d2b5","type":"text","text":"3.c.是 Detail page (详情页)， Descriptive Summary Quality (Bullet Points) 五点描述5%，五点描述数量大于等于3 条，且不含违禁关键词（关键词检查功能 ）。Number of bullet points >=3 and has no restricted keywords (keywords check ) 说明亚马逊对五点描述中违禁词、敏感词的自动化审查将更加严格。违禁词敏感词","x":1918,"y":-248,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"2297dd59c53c6a74","type":"text","text":"4.d..是 Detail page (详情页)， Image Quality (图片质量15%),网站图片数量 大于等于 4 张，且无图片质量缺陷。有缩放效果，Number of website images >=4 and no image quality defect.support zoom","x":1981,"y":-122,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"94f3b85adbc4eea5","type":"text","text":"5.e.是 Detail page (详情页)， A+ Content Quality (A+ 页面质量5%)，拥有 A+ 详情页内容。Has A plus content.","x":1983,"y":48,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"467cd36ce8914b59","type":"text","text":"6.f.是 Detail page (详情页)，  Variation Quality (变体质量)20%，整个变体家族中的变体主题和变体主题属性必须全部正确且保持一致。","x":2033,"y":205,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"85f7317d92272ead","type":"text","text":"7.g.是 Discoverability(可搜索性)，Product Type Classification (产品类型分类)20%，","x":2029,"y":314,"width":250,"height":60},
